<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>缂丝织机 · 卷轴贴合修正 V4</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#3c352c;background:#c4bcae}#stage{position:fixed;inset:0 330px 0 0;background:linear-gradient(#58534d,#b7b0a4 65%,#d0c8b8)}canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}header{position:fixed;top:28px;left:30px;pointer-events:none;color:#fff9eb;text-shadow:0 1px 10px #0004}header small{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;opacity:.75}h1{font-size:26px;font-weight:500;margin:8px 0}header p{font-size:12px;margin:0;opacity:.85}aside{position:fixed;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:330px;background:#f7f3e9;padding:22px;overflow:auto;box-shadow:-5px 0 30px #0001}h2{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 12px}#reference{width:100%;height:278px;object-fit:contain;background:#c7c0b4;border-radius:6px}#refname{font-size:10px;color:#90816c;margin:8px 0 15px}.row{display:flex;gap:5px;margin:8px 0}button,select{font:inherit;font-size:12px;border:1px solid #d5c8b2;border-radius:5px;background:#fffcf5;color:#5e4c34;padding:8px;cursor:pointer}button{flex:1;white-space:nowrap}button:hover{background:#e9dfcc}input,select{width:100%;accent-color:#987347}label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#86745a;margin-top:14px}input{margin:11px 0}select{margin-top:9px}aside p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#8a7e6b}#viewname{position:fixed;left:30px;bottom:48px;font-size:13px;color:#4f4536}#status{position:fixed;left:30px;bottom:25px;font-size:11px;color:#766954}#refgrid{position:absolute;top:40px;left:12px;right:12px;z-index:4;padding:10px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 18px #0004;border-radius:7px}#refgrid img{width:31%;height:105px;object-fit:cover;margin:1%;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:759px){#stage{inset:0 0 270px 0}header{top:18px;left:18px}h1{font-size:21px}header p{max-width:260px;line-height:1.6}aside{top:auto;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;width:auto;height:270px;padding:10px 15px}aside h2,#reference,#refname,#allrefs,aside p{display:none}label{margin-top:4px}.row{margin:5px 0}input{margin:7px 0}#viewname,#status{display:none}}
</style><div id="stage"><canvas id="view"></canvas></div><header><small>KESI LOOM / ROLLER WRAP / V4</small><h1>缂丝织机 · 卷轴贴合</h1><p>移除工具 · 连续经面与贴轴卷绕 · V4</p></header><aside><h2>原图对照</h2><img id="reference"><div id="refname"></div><button id="allrefs" style="width:100%">查看 4 张参考图</button><div id="refgrid" hidden></div><label>拆解程度 <span id="pct">0%</span></label><input id="explode" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0"><label>部件筛选</label><select id="group"><option value="all">完整结构</option><option value="frame">底架与轴座</option><option value="tower">提综架与承托木</option><option value="linkage">顶部单柱、销轴与直摆杆</option><option value="heddles">综丝与翻头</option><option value="rollers">经轴与卷布轴</option><option value="warp">经线</option><option value="cords">吊绳与牵绳</option><option value="treadles">宽向脚踏竹竿</option><option value="beater">织口横向构件</option><option value="cloth">贴轴卷绕织物</option><option value="bench">座凳</option></select><div class="row"><button id="oblique">斜视</button><button id="side">侧视</button><button id="front">前视</button><button id="rear">后视</button><button id="top">俯视</button></div><div class="row"><button id="detail">顶部近看</button><button id="clothdetail">卷轴近看</button></div><div class="row"><button id="spin">自动旋转</button><button id="reset">复位</button></div><div class="row"><button id="download">下载 GLB 模型</button></div><p>拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 右键平移。本轮移除全部梭子，缩短外露花布，并将织物沿切线连续卷入前轴。馆藏整机尺寸及专利依据见模型包内“尺寸与结构来源”。该馆藏不是本参考图原机，零件尺寸仍按图比例。</p></aside><div id="viewname"></div><div id="status">正在载入模型…</div><script>window.MODEL_B64='